  "label": "Rainbow Flag as LGBTQ+ Symbol",
  "description": "The rainbow flag is a globally recognized symbol of LGBTQ+ pride and identity. Its presence in the meme is essential to understand the 'gay son' option. The flag represents the LGBTQ+ community and its visibility is a key part of the meme's intent to contrast this identity with the 'thug' stereotype. Without knowledge of this symbol, the meaning of the 'gay son' option would be lost.",
